{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015_02_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1323f1ce4bf72484ae348d12823a4f1156f7601ac42d40f28f203bdb24d9042f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db2bc254e3fb15f955dbab94f3ac666e8659c6ab72e1c584d48d1d51c7c8ebc5",
      "text": "原来是助理教授啊。那更应该\n使用这边的空间了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fa676b385c5eed0e14bb030f0d4ead97ab98164abd581ec0261c11f4aa98e8b4",
      "text": "我并不是这所大学的人。\n只是今天来打扰一下的外人……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e0f917206b16fa9e6df2214242537ae970d2a2f92708db0b23f76fcc913b739",
      "text": "可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b62c33e00e971d4fbae6b5f4fdfe2de3ac647729869b560b6c0c8bf57ca41aee",
      "text": "……我明白了。非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9794015d64fe55d7c281ec01214a51128e041b5dd7ebe72a253fef5a89321ef9",
      "text": "那么，我就恭敬不如从命了。\n……希望能借此多来几位参与者。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:46cf18b87c8e3a2cd7c43f3eedc5120d76f0e930179160af2fa528cdfb8b7662",
      "text": "哇，海报上印着的这片海，真漂亮啊。\n难道说，您很喜欢大海吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25122fff851d1c3ed27325feec41b7c22fad197a72197e4224b08ada531a573a",
      "text": "……！是的，正如您所言！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe396d5ca4257ec7547fbfc8d971ee7b4c00e811acc95db545f22742c6d050b3",
      "text": "就算说海洋是我人生的全部，\n也毫不为过！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:91ccb321a65dacfe1f30bf82c4f42831ca1aac6c4bb99b3b427963b2dc81e62c",
      "text": "仅仅看了一眼这张照片，就察觉到了我灵魂的故乡——\n西班牙海域的壮美……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_02_1_1_015_02:1_1_015_02_c:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9b78c62867756eb7cfd9fc41a4c5abbc89128c7870ab69dd1b64e1f53a2b96e",
      "text": "太棒了。您能够理解呢，\n我对海洋的情感……以及，海洋的魅力！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
